messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_fax3.c
Line: 1762
Function: Fax3DecodeRLE
Bug type: divide-by-zero
CWE: CWE-369
Explanation: Uses occ % sp->b.rowbytes without guarding against sp->b.rowbytes == 0. If rowbytes is 0 (e.g., from a zero-width image), this results in a division by zero.

Source context:
```c
